  "rationales": {
    "U": "证据'It provides'：'It'指代不明，读者需要额外上下文来确定是什么实体提供指南，降低了需求的可理解性。",
    "A": "证据'It provides'：主语'It'模糊，可能指系统、文档或其他实体，造成歧义，影响需求的明确性。",
    "C": "证据'using GTK windowing toolkit for the X Window System'：GTK是X Window系统的常见工具包，技术内容正确，但需求未指定基线或上下文，可能存在隐含假设。",
    "V": "证据'identifies the effort required'：'effort'未定义如何测量或识别（例如通过时间、资源），使得需求无法测试或验证。"
  },
  "suggestions": {
    "U": "将'It'替换为具体实体，例如'The software system shall provide porting guidelines and identify the effort required to port the GUI library to the Linux platform using the GTK windowing toolkit for the X Window System.'",
    "A": "明确主语以消除歧义，例如改写为'The GUI porting tool shall provide porting guidelines and shall identify the effort required to port the GUI library to the Linux platform using the GTK windowing toolkit for the X Window System.'",
    "C": "保持不变",
    "V": "将'identifies the effort'具体化，例如'The system shall provide an estimated effort in person-days required to port the GUI library to the Linux platform using the GTK windowing toolkit for the X Window System.'"
  },
